majority:
    DNF (~a & b & c) | (a & ~b & c) | (a & b & ~c) | (a & b & c)
    CNF (a | b | c) & (a | b | ~c) & (a | ~b | c) & (~a | b | c)
    both match the table: true
odd parity:
    DNF (~a & ~b & c) | (~a & b & ~c) | (a & ~b & ~c) | (a & b & c)
    CNF (a | b | c) & (a | ~b | ~c) & (~a | b | ~c) & (~a | ~b | c)
    both match the table: true
a implies c:
    DNF (~a & ~b & ~c) | (~a & ~b & c) | (~a & b & ~c) | (~a & b & c) | (a & ~b & c) | (a & b & c)
    CNF (~a | b | c) & (~a | ~b | c)
    both match the table: true
